@page {
    layout: "home",
    meta: {
        title: "Rocci",
        description: "Composable authoring for applications and content. Preview a template, run an application, or author a Rocdown document.",
    },
}

@roc {
    import Datastar
    import LiveCounterUi
}

# Rocci

Composable authoring for applications and content.

:caution {{
    Highly experimental software. For testing only — not for production use.
}}

This website is one use case: it is built with [Rocci](/docs/the-stack/) and [Rocdown](/docs/rocdown/).

## Hybrid island deployment

The card below is the [live counter](/examples/live-counter/) app composed into this page: a CDN snapshot of static content (including the counter's initial state), plus a simple VPS-hosted reactive Rocci/Datastar component.

@render LiveCounterUi.CounterIsland({ count: 0.I64, clicks: LiveCounterUi.empty_clicks, show_reset: False })
<div data-init=@get("/sse", [OpenWhenHidden(True)])></div>

